                <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Constrained mixture theory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Humphrey &amp;amp; Rajagopal 2002)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;steps: page CMM – steps&lt;/i&gt;" link="data:page/id,cmm_steps" id="cmm">
